message: "If you use DiabPred in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DiabPred: An open-source machine learning toolkit for diabetes risk prediction"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-01-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SchrDbb/diabpred"
url: "https://github.com/SchrDbb/diabpred"
abstract: >
  DiabPred is an open-source Python toolkit for reproducible diabetes risk
  prediction using classical machine learning. It provides a unified benchmark
  of seven classifiers on the Pima Indians Diabetes Dataset, a clean prediction
  API, automated evaluation visualisations, and full reproducibility support.
keywords:
  - diabetes prediction
  - machine learning
  - scikit-learn
  - clinical decision support
  - reproducible research
  - open source
